### Check & consume quota (key = route, ip = caller; each ip tracks its own quota under the rule)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rate-limit/check?key=login:&ip=1.2.3.4

### POST create a rule
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rules
X-Admin-Token: changeme
Content-Type: application/json

{"keyPrefix": "login:", "limit": 100, "windowSeconds": 60}

### GET list of rule
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rules
X-Admin-Token: changeme

### GET rule by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rules/login:
X-Admin-Token: changeme

### Update rule by id
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rules/login:
X-Admin-Token: changeme
Content-Type: application/json

{"limit": 200, "windowSeconds": 60}

### Delete rule by id
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rules/login:
X-Admin-Token: changeme